      "text" : "Armory",
      "translation" : "军械库"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 22,
      "npc" : "Mason",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Library",
      "translation" : "图书馆"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 22,
      "npc" : "Mason",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Job Agency",
      "translation" : "转职所"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 22,
      "npc" : "Mason",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Prontera Castle",
      "translation" : "普隆德拉城堡"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 22,
      "npc" : "Mason",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "City Hall",
      "translation" : "市政厅"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 25,
      "npc" : "Mason",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Mason]",
      "translation" : "[梅森]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 26,
      "npc" : "Mason",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Hmm... I dunno why she would be there... guess I'll take a look.",
      "translation" : "嗯...我不知道她为什么会在那里...我去看看吧。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 30,
      "npc" : "Mason",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Mason]",
      "translation" : "[梅森]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 31,
      "npc" : "Mason",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Wow I never knew she was a religious person... I'll see to it thanks.",
      "translation" : "哇，我不知道她信教...我会去找她的，谢谢。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 35,
      "npc" : "Mason",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Mason]",
      "translation" : "[梅森]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 36,
      "npc" : "Mason",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Hmm.... are you sure about that?",
      "translation" : "嗯...你确定吗？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 40,
      "npc" : "Mason",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Mason]",
      "translation" : "[梅森]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 41,
      "npc" : "Mason",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Why would she need to go there? I think you might be mistaken.",
      "translation" : "她为什么要去那里？我觉得你可能弄错了。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 45,
      "npc" : "Mason",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Mason]",
      "translation" : "[梅森]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 46,
      "npc" : "Mason",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "The only thing she'd need at a Kit shop is medicine for her rheumatism. She's probably long gone from there by now.",
      "translation" : "她去套装商店唯一可能是买治风湿的药。她现在大概早就不在那里了。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 50,
      "npc" : "Mason",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Mason]",
      "translation" : "[梅森]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 51,
      "npc" : "Mason",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I don't think she needs to be there, she LIVES here in Prontera.",
      "translation" : "我觉得她不可能在那里，她就住在普隆德拉。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 55,
      "npc" : "Mason",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Mason]",
      "translation" : "[梅森]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 56,
      "npc" : "Mason",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Ah I see, if she's studying then I don't want to bother her. Thanks anyways.",
      "translation" : "啊，我明白了。如果她在学习，我就不去打扰她了。还是谢谢你。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 60,
      "npc" : "Mason",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Mason]",
      "translation" : "[梅森]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 61,
      "npc" : "Mason",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Job Agency?  I don't think so.  Don't lead me all around Prontera please! She's already a teacher here.",
      "translation" : "转职所？我觉得不是吧。别带着我在普隆德拉到处跑了！她已经是这里的老师了。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 65,
      "npc" : "Mason",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Mason]",
      "translation" : "[梅森]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 66,
      "npc" : "Mason",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "The castle eh, I don't want to step in there... just doesn't feel like my style. I don't like that noble feeling of importance type of thing.",
      "translation" : "城堡啊...我不想进去...感觉不适合我。我不喜欢那种贵族高高在上的气派。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 70,
      "npc" : "Mason",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Mason]",
      "translation" : "[梅森]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 71,
      "npc" : "Mason",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "O wow, did she become an important part of Prontera? I'd think she's too busy for me to visit. I'll try again later.",
      "translation" : "哇，她成了普隆德拉的重要人物吗？她应该很忙，我还是改天再去拜访吧。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 75,
      "npc" : "Mason",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Mason]",
      "translation" : "[梅森]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 76,
      "npc" : "Mason",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Ah, I heard that her class was somewhere around there... thanks a lot! Here's a lil something for your help.",
      "translation" : "啊，我听说她的教室就在那附近...太感谢你了！这是给你的谢礼。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 83,
      "npc" : "Mason",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Yay, I found her! Thank you very much for you help!",
      "translation" : "耶，我找到她了！非常感谢你的帮助！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 87,
      "npc" : "Mason",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Hi! I came here to Prontera in search of an old lady... But...",
      "translation" : "嗨！我来普隆德拉找一位老太太...不过..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 90,
      "npc" : "Mason",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Oh.. Ok.. Thanks anyways.",
      "translation" : "哦...好吧...还是谢谢你。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 95,
      "npc" : "Mojo",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Mojo]",
      "translation" : "[莫乔]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 97,
      "npc" : "Mojo",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Oh no!  I lost my teacher's ^FF0000old magic book^000000!",
      "translation" : "糟了！我把老师的^FF0000古老魔法书^000000弄丢了！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 98,
      "npc" : "Mojo",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "What am I going to do... those dumb Bathory...",
      "translation" : "我该怎么办...那些笨蛋巴托莉..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 103,
      "npc" : "Mojo",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I lost my teacher's book!  What am I going to do...",
      "translation" : "我把老师的书弄丢了！我该怎么办..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 108,
      "npc" : "Marie",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Marie]",
      "translation" : "[玛丽]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 112,
      "npc" : "Marie",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Hello, is there something you need?",
      "translation" : "你好，有什么需要吗？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 114,
      "npc" : "Marie",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "No nothing at all.",
      "translation" : "没什么事。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 114,
      "npc" : "Marie",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Your teacher sent me.",
      "translation" : "你的老师派我来的。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 116,
      "npc" : "Marie",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Marie]",
      "translation" : "[玛丽]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 117,
      "npc" : "Marie",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "What does he want from me?",
      "translation" : "他找我有什么事？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 120,
      "npc" : "Marie",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Marie]",
      "translation" : "[玛丽]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 121,
      "npc" : "Marie",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Oh wait, I see... he wants his reference scroll back am I right? Well, I'm kinda still using it buuut... I'll give it back if you can gimme a poring egg and an incubator. Those things are so cute!",
      "translation" : "哦，等等，我明白了...他想要回参考卷轴，对吧？我还在用呢，不过...如果你能给我一个波利蛋和一个宠物孵化器，我就还给他。这些东西太可爱了！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 126,
      "npc" : "Marie",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Hi! What do you want from me?",
      "translation" : "嗨！你找我有什么事？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 130,
      "npc" : "Marie",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Marie]",
      "translation" : "[玛丽]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 131,
      "npc" : "Marie",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Hrrmm okay? Cya then..",
      "translation" : "嗯，好吧？那回头见..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 135,
      "npc" : "Marie",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Heyyy there, you have a poring egg and the pet incubator to go with it! Are those for me?",
      "translation" : "嘿，你带了波利蛋和宠物孵化器！这些是给我的吗？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 136,
      "npc" : "Marie",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Yep!",
      "translation" : "是的！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 136,
      "npc" : "Marie",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Sorry, no.",
      "translation" : "不是，抱歉。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 138,
      "npc" : "Marie",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Marie]",
      "translation" : "[玛丽]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 140,
      "npc" : "Marie",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Yatta!  Here's a lil something in return.",
      "translation" : "太好啦！这是给你的一点回礼。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 148,
      "npc" : "Marie",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Oh.. pooo... sigh...",
      "translation" : "哦...波利...唉..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 153,
      "npc" : "Marie",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Yay! I love Porings!",
      "translation" : "耶！我最喜欢波利了！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 158,
      "npc" : "Wise Man Fabius",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Fabius]",
      "translation" : "[法比乌斯]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 161,
      "npc" : "Wise Man Fabius",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "You speak Umbalian fluently! So you will never forget the language of Umbalians!",
      "translation" : "你已经能流利地说汶巴拉语了！所以永远不会忘记汶巴拉人的语言！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 169,
      "npc" : "Wise Man Fabius",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Ah, you've done well in retrieving my references. These artifacts holds information about ruins around the world, from the burning hell of the Magma Dungeon, to the strange eerie Hidden Forest of Yggdrasil.",
      "translation" : "啊，你顺利找回了我的参考资料。这些文物记载着世界各地遗迹的信息，从岩浆洞窟的灼热地狱，到伊格德拉修树的诡异幽暗森林。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 171,
      "npc" : "Wise Man Fabius",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Fabius]",
      "translation" : "[法比乌斯]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 172,
      "npc" : "Wise Man Fabius",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "But enough talk, you're just eager to get your reward aren't you?  Well it may not sound much, but my reward for you is knowledge...",
      "translation" : "不过话说回来，你只是急着领报酬，对吧？听起来可能不算什么，但我要给你的奖励是知识..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 174,
      "npc" : "Wise Man Fabius",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Fabius]",
      "translation" : "[法比乌斯]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 175,
      "npc" : "Wise Man Fabius",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Actually it is knowledge of the Umbalian people. They are connected to this world of Midgard in some special way, we just can't confirm it yet. There is a theory that they may be like the elves and protect the ancient tree of Yggdrasil.",
      "translation" : "更准确地说，是汶巴拉人的知识。他们与米德加尔特世界有某种特殊联系，只是我们还不能确定。有一种说法认为，他们像精灵一样守护着古老的伊格德拉修树。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 177,
      "npc" : "Wise Man Fabius",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Fabius]",
      "translation" : "[法比乌斯]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 178,
      "npc" : "Wise Man Fabius",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "And I, a great wise man of Juno, will teach you their language!",
      "translation" : "而我，朱诺伟大的智者，将教你他们的语言！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 180,
      "npc" : "Wise Man Fabius",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "^0000FF Learned the language of Umbalians! ^000000",
      "translation" : "^0000FF学会了汶巴拉人的语言！^000000"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 192,
      "npc" : "Wise Man Fabius",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Argh! My three students ran off with my references! Hey you! Can you get them back for me? I'll gladly reward you.",
      "translation" : "哎呀！我的三个学生带着参考资料跑掉了！喂，你能帮我找回来吗？我一定会好好酬谢你。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 194,
      "npc" : "Wise Man Fabius",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Fabius]",
      "translation" : "[法比乌斯]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 195,
      "npc" : "Wise Man Fabius",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "From what I know, they're in different separate towns making something out of themselves.",
      "translation" : "据我所知，他们分散在不同的城镇，各自忙着自己的事情。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 197,
      "npc" : "Wise Man Fabius",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Oh... You found Marie in Amatsu.",
      "translation" : "哦...你在天津町找到了玛丽。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 198,
      "npc" : "Wise Man Fabius",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "You saw Mojo in Aldebaran?",
      "translation" : "你在艾尔帕兰见到了莫乔？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 199,
      "npc" : "Wise Man Fabius",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "So... Mason's in Prontera now... Well...",
      "translation" : "那么...梅森现在在普隆德拉...嗯..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 200,
      "npc" : "Wise Man Fabius",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I wonder where is our sea girl Marie?",
      "translation" : "不知道海边的女孩玛丽在哪里？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 201,
      "npc" : "Wise Man Fabius",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Mojo should be somewhere near water...",
      "translation" : "莫乔应该在水边附近..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 202,
      "npc" : "Wise Man Fabius",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Where'd Mason go then...",
      "translation" : "那么梅森去哪儿了..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 203,
      "npc" : "Wise Man Fabius",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Oh yeah, tell them I sent you",
      "translation" : "对了，告诉他们是我派你去的。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 206,
      "npc" : "Wise Man Fabius",
